               too far behind enemy levels. Jormungandr relic investment is the primary lever.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="floor-prog-block floor-prog-500">
            <div class="floor-prog-label">500+</div>
            <p>Much less forgiving than Spades or Hearts at equivalent investment. Progress is
               possible but Clubs will feel incomplete compared to Spades or Hearts.
               Expect higher variance and fewer clean runs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

