                <span class="hero-pic-name">Anubis</span>
              </a>
              <a href="/heroes/nuba" class="hero-pic">
                <div class="hero-pic-img" style={`background-image:url('${hp("nuba")}')`}></div>
                <span class="hero-pic-name">Nuba</span>
              </a>
              <a href="/heroes/diana" class="hero-pic">
                <div class="hero-pic-img" style={`background-image:url('${hp("diana")}')`}></div>
                <span class="hero-pic-name">Diana</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <p class="variant-note">Transitional setup before a stronger squad is assembled. Jormungandr carries with control support.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="variant-card">
            <div class="variant-label variant-mid">Utility Variant</div>
            <div class="hero-pic-grid">
              <a href="/heroes/jormungandr" class="hero-pic pic-highlight">
                <div class="hero-pic-img" style={`background-image:url('${hp("jormungandr")}')`}></div>
                <span class="hero-pic-name">Jormungandr</span>
              </a>
              <a href="/heroes/wenshen" class="hero-pic">
                <div class="hero-pic-img" style={`background-image:url('${hp("wenshen")}')`}></div>
                <span class="hero-pic-name">Wenshen</span>
              </a>
              <a href="/heroes/anubis" class="hero-pic">
                <div class="hero-pic-img" style={`background-image:url('${hp("anubis")}')`}></div>
                <span class="hero-pic-name">Anubis</span>
              </a>
              <a href="/heroes/pan" class="hero-pic">
                <div class="hero-pic-img" style={`background-image:url('${hp("pan")}')`}></div>
                <span class="hero-pic-name">Pan</span>
              </a>
              <a href="/heroes/diana" class="hero-pic">
                <div class="hero-pic-img" style={`background-image:url('${hp("diana")}')`}></div>
                <span class="hero-pic-name">Diana</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <p class="variant-note">Diana over Nuba for extra support and tempo. Use when floors require better team flow rather than frontline weight.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="variant-card">
            <div class="variant-label variant-endgame">Best Available</div>
            <div class="hero-pic-grid">
              <a href="/heroes/jormungandr" class="hero-pic pic-highlight">
                <div class="hero-pic-img" style={`background-image:url('${hp("jormungandr")}')`}></div>
                <span class="hero-pic-name">Jormungandr</span>
              </a>
              <a href="/heroes/wenshen" class="hero-pic">
                <div class="hero-pic-img" style={`background-image:url('${hp("wenshen")}')`}></div>
                <span class="hero-pic-name">Wenshen</span>
              </a>
              <a href="/heroes/anubis" class="hero-pic">
                <div class="hero-pic-img" style={`background-image:url('${hp("anubis")}')`}></div>
                <span class="hero-pic-name">Anubis</span>
              </a>
              <a href="/heroes/pan" class="hero-pic">
                <div class="hero-pic-img" style={`background-image:url('${hp("pan")}')`}></div>
                <span class="hero-pic-name">Pan</span>
              </a>
              <a href="/heroes/nuba" class="hero-pic">
                <div class="hero-pic-img" style={`background-image:url('${hp("nuba")}')`}></div>
                <span class="hero-pic-name">Nuba</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <p class="variant-note">Best available Clubs setup. Jormungandr relic 20-30 is the investment gate.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tw-warning-box tw-warning-clubs-critical">
          <div class="tw-warning-title">Warnings</div>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Level Suppression is the main enemy for Clubs at high floors.</strong> Jormungandr's True Damage works correctly - close the level gap before adjusting relic investment.</li>
            <li><strong>Spades and Hearts will outperform Clubs at the same investment level.</strong> Prioritize those first if resources are limited.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- ================================================================
           SECTION 10: REPLACEMENT PHILOSOPHY
           ================================================================ -->
      <div class="tw-card">
        <h2>Replacement Philosophy</h2>
        <p>
          Not every slot is interchangeable. Understanding which slots are locked prerequisites and
          which are genuine flex positions is what separates correct building from wasted resources.
        </p>

        <div class="replacement-philosophy-grid">
          <div class="replacement-tier-card tier-none">
            <div class="tier-card-label">No Replacement Exists</div>
            <p>
              Some deities are so structurally central that removing them produces a different team,
              not a weaker version. These are prerequisites, not optional upgrades:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Skadi (Spades)</li>
              <li>Mengpo (Hearts)</li>
              <li>Heracles (Diamonds)</li>
              <li>Jormungandr (Clubs)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="replacement-tier-card tier-flex">
            <div class="tier-card-label">Genuine Flex Slots</div>
            <p>
              A minority of slots are genuine flex positions where two available heroes offer
              comparable value depending on the floor.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Khepri / Iris (Spades)</li>
              <li>Cancer / Yanluo (Hearts)</li>
              <li>Bastet / Set / Athena (Diamonds)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ================================================================
           SECTION 11: INVESTMENT PRIORITY
           ================================================================ -->
      <div class="tw-card">
        <h2>Investment Priority</h2>
        <p>
          Follow this ordering to avoid misplaced resources.
        </p>

        <h3>Priority Tier 1 - Non-Negotiable Gates</h3>
        <div class="invest-list">
          <div class="invest-row invest-critical">
            <span class="invest-hero">Skadi relic</span>
            <span class="invest-target">30+ for 500+, 40 for endgame - top priority</span>
            <span class="invest-faction faction-tag-spades">Spades</span>
          </div>
          <div class="invest-row invest-critical">
            <span class="invest-hero">Mengpo relic</span>
            <span class="invest-target">30 mandatory - highest Hearts priority</span>
            <span class="invest-faction faction-tag-hearts">Hearts</span>
          </div>
          <div class="invest-row invest-critical">
            <span class="invest-hero">Heracles relic</span>
            <span class="invest-target">30 mandatory, 40-50 luxury</span>
            <span class="invest-faction faction-tag-diamonds">Diamonds</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3>Priority Tier 2 - Carry Enablers</h3>
        <div class="invest-list">
          <div class="invest-row invest-high">
            <span class="invest-hero">Hladgunnr relic</span>
            <span class="invest-target">30-40</span>
            <span class="invest-faction faction-tag-hearts">Hearts</span>
          </div>
          <div class="invest-row invest-high">
            <span class="invest-hero">Caishen relic</span>
            <span class="invest-target">20 early, 30 for 500+</span>
            <span class="invest-faction faction-tag-hearts">Hearts</span>
          </div>
          <div class="invest-row invest-high">
            <span class="invest-hero">Poseidon relic</span>
            <span class="invest-target">10-20 baseline</span>
            <span class="invest-faction faction-tag-spades">Spades</span>
          </div>
          <div class="invest-row invest-high">
            <span class="invest-hero">Bastet relic</span>
            <span class="invest-target">20-30</span>
            <span class="invest-faction faction-tag-diamonds">Diamonds</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3>What to Avoid Right Now</h3>
        <div class="tw-warning-box tw-warning-invest">
          <div class="tw-warning-title">Hold Investment Here</div>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Jormungandr beyond relic 30 without closing the level gap first:</strong> Relic investment only matters when you are within 15 levels of floor enemies. Close the gap before pushing relic further.</li>
            <li><strong>Clubs as your primary faction if you also need to build Spades or Hearts:</strong> Spades and Hearts have higher ceilings currently. Prioritize those first if resources are limited.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ================================================================
           SECTION 12: FINAL TAKEAWAYS
           ================================================================ -->
      <div class="tw-card tw-takeaways-card">
        <h2>Final Takeaways</h2>

        <div class="takeaway-grid">
          <div class="takeaway-block takeaway-spades">
            <div class="takeaway-faction-header">
              <img src={fi("spades")} alt="Spades" class="takeaway-icon" />
              <span>Spades</span>
            </div>
            <p class="takeaway-verdict">Best and safest Celestial Spire investment. Build here first.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Skadi is the irreplaceable prerequisite</li>
              <li>Iris is a solid fifth slot with natural synergy</li>
              <li>Most forgiving execution of all factions</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="takeaway-block takeaway-hearts">
            <div class="takeaway-faction-header">
              <img src={fi("hearts")} alt="Hearts" class="takeaway-icon" />
              <span>Hearts</span>
            </div>
            <p class="takeaway-verdict">Top-tier second faction. Core is fully intact.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Mengpo relic is the single most important support investment</li>
              <li>Hladgunnr is the carry - protect and enable her</li>
              <li>Cannot be substituted around at high floors</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="takeaway-block takeaway-diamonds">
            <div class="takeaway-faction-header">
              <img src={fi("diamonds")} alt="Diamonds" class="takeaway-icon" />
              <span>Diamonds</span>
            </div>
            <p class="takeaway-verdict">Playable. Higher variance than Spades or Hearts.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Athena is the best available fifth slot - reliable and safe</li>
              <li>Heracles relic gate is real and non-negotiable</li>
              <li>Approach with realistic expectations about ceiling</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="takeaway-block takeaway-clubs-warn">
            <div class="takeaway-faction-header">
              <img src={fi("clubs")} alt="Clubs" class="takeaway-icon" />
              <span>Clubs</span>
            </div>
            <p class="takeaway-verdict">Weakest faction currently. Viable push, but requires the most level management.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Best squad: Jormungandr, Wenshen, Anubis, Pan, Nuba</li>
              <li>Jormungandr is the centerpiece - True Damage works, Level Suppression is the factor to manage</li>
              <li>Close the level gap before investing further in relics</li>
              <li>Prioritize Spades and Hearts first if resources are limited</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tw-callout tw-callout-final">
          <strong>500+ is endgame territory.</strong> Focus on assembling the correct core team
          structure before pushing floors. Relic investment on the right deities matters more
          than overall roster star level.
        </div>
      </div>

    </main>
  </div>

</Base>

